{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":12.96},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":13.6,"end":26.56},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.16,"end":39.04}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.72,"text":"AND 只有兩個輸入都真才為真。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.44,"end":6.72,"text":"它可描述需要兩個授權同時成立的門。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.28,"end":9.92,"text":"只測兩者皆真並不足夠，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.08,"end":12.96,"text":"因為錯用 OR 也會通過這個測試。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":13.6,"end":15.92,"text":"關閉警報並選 AND，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.08,"end":19.92,"text":"測試 00、10、01、11，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.32,"end":22,"text":"記錄哪組會開門。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.52,"end":26.56,"text":"哪組輸入能區分 AND 和 OR？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.16,"end":31.36,"text":"哪組輸入能區分 AND 和 OR？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.56,"end":36,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.56,"end":39.04,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}